  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat a grill or grill pan to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Season the beef patties with salt and pepper.",
    "3. Grill the beef patties for 4-5 minutes per side, or until they reach an internal temperature of 160°F.",
    "4. Meanwhile, grill the minari leaves for 1-2 minutes per side, or until they're crispy.",
    "5. Grill the bacon slices until crispy.",
    "6. Assemble the burgers by spreading mayonnaise on the bottom bun, followed by a beef patty, bacon, minari, cheese, lettuce, tomato, and onion.",
